          "name": "Commandos (Heavy Weapons)",
          "ref": "v3 page 23 AoGB",
          "text": "Commando machine gun teams, mortar teams, anti-tank teams, and flamethrower teams can fire any small arms they carry, if the team is not firing the main weapon."
